02>\nare cartesian squares. By Lemma <REF_0004>\nthe\nalgebraic space <MATH_0024>\nis a pseudo torsor for <MATH_0025>\nover <MATH_0026>. Thus the equivalences in (4) and (5) follow from\nGroupoids in Spaces, Lemma\n<REF_0005>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a6b73aed0819fe18396a454b9d6cf4a62b531a1776e0a69aff4863c8714df153", "unit_id": "tag:0CL0:proof"}
